---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../../components/SectionHeading.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Career Opportunities | Zeta" description="Explore Financial Advisor development and leadership pathways with Zeta.">
  <header class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Career Opportunities</p>
      <h1>Explore a Professional Path Built Around Growth and Responsibility</h1>
      <p>Zeta is seeking people who are willing to learn, serve clients responsibly, accept mentorship, and contribute to a professional community.</p>
      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="button button-accent" href="/careers/apply">Start Your Application</a>
        <a class="button button-ghost" href="/contact">Ask a Recruitment Question</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section" id="financial-advisor">
    <div class="shell feature-grid">
      <article>
          <SectionHeading 
            eyebrow="Pathway 01" 
            title="Financial Advisor Development" 
            text="Designed for aspiring professionals, career shifters, and experienced client-facing people who want structured development in financial services." 
          />
          <ul class="check-list">
            <li>Orientation to the profession and expectations</li>
            <li>Training, mentorship, and practical development</li>
            <li>Financial education and client-service foundations</li>
            <li>Opportunity to grow through demonstrated capability and responsibility</li>
          </ul>
      </article>
        
      <aside class="info-panel">
        <h3>Good starting indicators</h3>
        <p>Professionalism, coachability, communication, reliability, a service orientation, and willingness to complete required training and licensing steps.</p>
        <p><strong>Experience note:</strong> prior financial-services experience may be helpful, but relevant sales, customer-service, business-development, teaching, community, or leadership experience can also be valuable.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt" id="leadership-pathway">
    <div class="shell feature-grid">
      <aside class="info-panel info-panel-dark">
        <h3>Leadership readiness</h3>
        <p>This pathway requires more than ambition. Candidates should show evidence of accountability, mentoring ability, professional judgment, team contribution, and long-term commitment to developing others.</p>
      </aside>

      <article>
          <SectionHeading 
            eyebrow="Pathway 02" 
            title="Leadership and Organization Building" 
            text="For professionals who want to develop the capability to mentor, guide teams, strengthen systems, and contribute to Zeta’s long-term growth." 
          />
          <ul class="check-list">
            <li>Leadership-development exposure</li>
            <li>Mentoring and team-building practice</li>
            <li>Increasing responsibility based on readiness and results</li>
            <li>Long-term organization-building direction</li>
          </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell narrow">
      <h2>What the process may include</h2>
      <ol class="process-list">
        <li><strong>Explore:</strong> Review the opportunity, expectations, and development environment.</li>
        <li><strong>Apply:</strong> Submit relevant background, career goals, availability, licensing status, and training readiness.</li>
        <li><strong>Discuss:</strong> Participate in an initial conversation or orientation to clarify fit and expectations.</li>
        <li><strong>Assess:</strong> Complete the appropriate interview, requirements, and readiness review.</li>
        <li><strong>Develop:</strong> Begin the approved onboarding, training, licensing, and mentorship pathway.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="verification-note">The final process, qualification standards, licensing requirements, compensation structure, and candidate status must be confirmed before public launch.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="final-cta">
    <div class="shell final-cta-inner">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Take the next step</p>
        <h2>Ready to Explore Your Fit With Zeta?</h2>
        <p>Submit an application when you are ready to be considered, or send an inquiry when you need more information first.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="button-row button-row-end">
        <a class="button button-accent" href="/careers/apply">Submit an Application</a>
        <a class="button button-ghost" href="/contact">Send an Inquiry</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
